      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Welcome to the Heart Anatomy Lab! Here, you'll explore the heart, a remarkable
    organ that pumps over 2,000 gallons of blood daily and beats approximately 100,000
    times in 24 hours. This immersive VR experience takes you through the heart's
    vital structures, from the protective epicardium to the intricate chordae tendineae.
    Each component plays a vital role in our body's circulatory system, ensuring
    oxygen-rich blood reaches every cell. Whether for academic studies or personal
    curiosity, this lab offers an insightful glimpse into the heart's complexities.
    Embark on this educational journey and discover the wonders of cardiac anatomy!
