  m_text: 'In VR, developers are only limited by thier imaginations. It is possible 
    to create and import any type of 3D asset, such as a 3D heart replica like is
    featured in this Learning Module. In addition, developers can create entire worlds
    that are replicas of the real world or completely unique spaces.  For these reasons,
    VR has immense educational potential. This course will explore some of the key
    tools and applications for VR learning. Click "Next" to continue or revist this
    page through the course map menus.


'
