  m_text: "The skull is a bony structure located in the head, serving as the protective
    encasement for the brain. Comprised of 22 individual bones, the skull is divided
    into two main sections:\r\n\rCranial Bones (8) and Facial Bones (14)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
