  m_text: "Over the past few years, VR devices have improved handtracking capabilities
    dramatically.  By now, you have noticed your blue hands. If you move or waive
    your hands, their exact location and motion are tracked. This allows you to use
    your hands to interact within VR and creates the potential any application that
    uses your hands. For education, this is excting because complex interactions
    can be replicated. \n"
